msgid "The Cloud plugin requires the PHP extensions %s, which this server does not load, so the plugin was not installed or enabled."
msgstr "የCloud ተሰኪው %s የPHP ቅጥያዎችን ይፈልጋል፣ ይህ አገልጋይ ስለማይጭናቸው ተሰኪው አልተጫነም ወይም አልነቃም።"

